* HSFPC Tutorial 3: power loop of a GaN half-bridge, return on the first inner layer (L2)
* Forward copper on L1: 4 mm wide, 10 mm long, 35 um thick; solid plane on L2, 0.1 mm below;
* four vias (0.3 mm, modelled as squares with the same perimeter) at each end.
* Run: fasthenry loop_L2_return.inp   -> loop impedance in Zc.mat; L = Im(Z)/(2*pi*f)
* To move the return plane (e.g. to L4, 1.5 mm below), change z = 0.135 of all L1 nodes and via top nodes
* (0.135 mm = 0.1 mm dielectric + 35 um copper) to 1.535.
.units mm
* conductivity of copper in 1/(Ohm*mm)
.default sigma=5.8e4

* --- plane on L2 (z = 0), 0.5 mm mesh ---
G1 x1=-6.0 y1=-8.0 z1=0 x2=16.0 y2=-8.0 z2=0 x3=16.0 y3=8.0 z3=0 thick=0.035 seg1=44 seg2=32 nhinc=1
+ Npf0 (9.7000,-1.5000,0)
+ Npf1 (9.7000,-0.5000,0)
+ Npf2 (9.7000,0.5000,0)
+ Npf3 (9.7000,1.5000,0)
+ Npr0 (-1.5000,-1.5000,0)
+ Npr1 (-1.5000,-0.5000,0)
+ Npr2 (-1.5000,0.5000,0)
+ Npr3 (-1.5000,1.5000,0)

* --- forward copper on L1, from the capacitor (x = 0) to the switches (x = 10 mm) ---
Ns0 x=0 y=0 z=0.1350
Ns1 x=10.0 y=0 z=0.1350
Efwd Ns0 Ns1 w=4.0 h=0.035 nwinc=15 nhinc=1 rw=2.0

* --- return pad of the capacitor on L1 (1 mm gap), 1 mm long ---
Nr0 x=-1.0 y=0 z=0.1350
Nr1 x=-2.0 y=0 z=0.1350
Epad Nr0 Nr1 w=4.0 h=0.035 nwinc=7 nhinc=1

* --- vias from L1 to the plane: at the switches (x = 9.7 mm) and at the capacitor pad (x = -1.5 mm) ---
Nvt0 x=9.7000 y=-1.5000 z=0.1350
Nvb0 x=9.7000 y=-1.5000 z=0.0175
Evia0 Nvt0 Nvb0 w=0.2356 h=0.2356 nwinc=3 nhinc=3
Nvt1 x=9.7000 y=-0.5000 z=0.1350
Nvb1 x=9.7000 y=-0.5000 z=0.0175
Evia1 Nvt1 Nvb1 w=0.2356 h=0.2356 nwinc=3 nhinc=3
Nvt2 x=9.7000 y=0.5000 z=0.1350
Nvb2 x=9.7000 y=0.5000 z=0.0175
Evia2 Nvt2 Nvb2 w=0.2356 h=0.2356 nwinc=3 nhinc=3
Nvt3 x=9.7000 y=1.5000 z=0.1350
Nvb3 x=9.7000 y=1.5000 z=0.0175
Evia3 Nvt3 Nvb3 w=0.2356 h=0.2356 nwinc=3 nhinc=3
Nwt0 x=-1.5 y=-1.5000 z=0.1350
Nwb0 x=-1.5 y=-1.5000 z=0.0175
Ewia0 Nwt0 Nwb0 w=0.2356 h=0.2356 nwinc=3 nhinc=3
Nwt1 x=-1.5 y=-0.5000 z=0.1350
Nwb1 x=-1.5 y=-0.5000 z=0.0175
Ewia1 Nwt1 Nwb1 w=0.2356 h=0.2356 nwinc=3 nhinc=3
Nwt2 x=-1.5 y=0.5000 z=0.1350
Nwb2 x=-1.5 y=0.5000 z=0.0175
Ewia2 Nwt2 Nwb2 w=0.2356 h=0.2356 nwinc=3 nhinc=3
Nwt3 x=-1.5 y=1.5000 z=0.1350
Nwb3 x=-1.5 y=1.5000 z=0.0175
Ewia3 Nwt3 Nwb3 w=0.2356 h=0.2356 nwinc=3 nhinc=3

* --- connections ---
.equiv Nvb0 Npf0
.equiv Nvt0 Ns1
.equiv Nwb0 Npr0
.equiv Nwt0 Nr1
.equiv Nvb1 Npf1
.equiv Nvt1 Ns1
.equiv Nwb1 Npr1
.equiv Nwt1 Nr1
.equiv Nvb2 Npf2
.equiv Nvt2 Ns1
.equiv Nwb2 Npr2
.equiv Nwt2 Nr1
.equiv Nvb3 Npf3
.equiv Nvt3 Ns1
.equiv Nwb3 Npr3
.equiv Nwt3 Nr1

* --- port across the capacitor position: forward copper start and capacitor return pad ---
.external Ns0 Nr0
.freq fmin=1e6 fmax=1e8 ndec=1
.end
